        text: 'The arcade opens onto Calle de Espoz y Mina: number 7 is about 1 minute / 40–80 m (Dubliners and O’Connell’s, same number, two doors). Four Corner at Calle de la Victoria 6 is about 2 minutes / 120–180 m around the corner. Do not wait on Victoria 6 before 14:00. Named listings: Dubliners What’s On only.',
      },
